flowchart TD
    A[Power ON Board] --> B[Boot STM32 Firmware]
    B --> C[Initialize Clock]
    C --> D[Initialize GPIO]
    D --> E[Initialize UART]
    E --> F[Enter Main Loop]
    F --> G[Generate Dummy Telemetry]
    G --> H[Format Text Packet]
    H --> I[Transmit over UART]
    I --> J[Open Serial Terminal on Laptop]
    J --> K[Read Telemetry]
    K --> L[Display / Log Output]
